                                "example_id": "e136af69-72b4-4908-abbe-f8dda3ebcca9",
                                "sense_id": "2043beff-d87a-3257-b04e-cc4d46d2fd55",
                                "text": "In addition to all this, the fluidity of the steam itself was much increased by high superheat, usually achieved by means of the Houlet superheater. […] When the engine is working hard, the temperature of the steam is usually raised by the superheater to about 750° F."
                            }
